      "id": "claim_02a3292b94514936b7fbbbe869876251",
      "statement": "Deep Agents is a three-layer stack: LangGraph is the runtime (state, checkpoints, streaming, interrupts), LangChain create_agent is the agent abstraction that builds the model-plus-tools-plus-middleware loop on top of LangGraph, and Deep Agents is an opinionated harness on top of create_agent.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L73-L75",
